# Instance-tier coordination state — untracked-by-design (ADR-199 / PDR-094).
# Preserved on disk, not carried in git. The durable decision-provenance
# surfaces (conversations/, escalations/, sidebars/) and the README stay tracked.
_tmp-*
*.seen
comms/*
comms-seen/*
# A watcher seen-file / heartbeat mis-placed at the collaboration root (it belongs in
# comms-seen/) must still never be committed — F-69, the 2026-06-18 Bluebell instance.
*-seen.json
*.heartbeat.json
comms-draft/*
handoffs/*
!handoffs/README.md
active-claims.json
closed-claims.archive.json
shared-comms-log.md
comms-archive/*
!comms-archive/.gitkeep
# Processed (knowledge-extracted) conversations/sidebars/handoffs are archive-moved
# here, untracked-by-design (see archive/README.md). Only the README is tracked.
archive/*
!archive/README.md